  "notes": "Karakeep (open-source Hoarder) bookmarks home. Colorful generated banner thumbnails (site name, title, monospace domain on saturated gradient tiles) provide nearly all color against a gray-white shadcn UI. Tag chips are pale gray pills (rounded-full). Cards show a hover toolbar (drag handle, select checkbox, archive, favourite star); favourites marked with a yellow star on the banner. Failed fetches show a gray band with a single-letter monogram. Masonry with adjustable column count (slider) and display toggles in View options. Sort is an icon-only button with no visible current-order label. Note cards render markdown checklists inline."
